# Legacy Cursor rules entrypoint

Prefer `.cursor/rules/evidenceoflife.mdc` and `AGENTS.md`.

This file exists for tools that still read `.cursorrules`.

- Stack: Vite + React 18 + TypeScript + Tailwind 3 + Supabase
- Always: `npm run typecheck` after TS changes; `npm test` after logic changes
- No secrets; no fabricated features/results
- Demo verification: http://localhost:8080/demo-app
- Security-sensitive: migrations, auth, edge OAuth/auth helpers, photo storage
- Full policy: AGENTS.md | Map: llms.txt
